WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:12.500
It’s project time! Generate a city skyline from procedures: a building procedure with a height parameter called in a loop with random arguments, plus at least one detail procedure.

2
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:17.450
Games like Minecraft generate worlds from procedures and random numbers.

3
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.990
You’ll generate a city skyline.

4
00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:26.210
building (height) draws a rectangle of a fixed width and the given height.

5
00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:28.540
Call it with random heights.

6
00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:35.150
Add procedures for windows, roofs, trees or stars — each one small and tested.

7
00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:40.270
List your procedures, their parameters and what each draws before you code.

8
00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:43.740
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

9
00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:47.150
Now plan it, build it, test it, and share it!
